they're also using Kubeflow.

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:20.900
Did you know that CERN has been
using Kubeflow for over a year?

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.540
They're one of our oldest users.

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:24.165
JON FOUST: I actually
didn't know that.

00:06:24.165 --> 00:06:26.205
